| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `[0,30]` | `[]` | New room | `[30]` |
| `[5,10]` | `[30]` | 30 > 5 → new room | `[10, 30]` |
| `[15,20]` | `[10, 30]` | 10 ≤ 15 → reuse | `[20, 30]` |

Result: `heap.size() = 2` — two rooms needed at peak.

